NETFLIX ANIME

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:06.139
We'll make "N-ko Japanese" a regular segment.

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:08.008
"Isn't it awesome?"

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:09.743
Ta-da!

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.745
Hi, it's N-ko!

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:15.382
This week's The N-ko Show has started!

00:00:15.382 --> 00:00:19.452
Today, I'd like to give you a simple recipe of the breakfast

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:22.288
I've been having lately.

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:24.791
Get three eggs,

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:30.130
break them into a bowl, and whisk.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:33.199
Then add 150ml of water.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:37.837
After that, add about two tablespoons of Japanese noodle soup base.

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:44.944
If you haven't got that, please use a little soy sauce instead.

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:47.914
Mix them all together, cover with cling wrap,

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:53.219
heat it in the microwave for about two minutes till it's cooked.

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:55.422
That's been my breakfast lately.

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:57.223
(What will you get from that?)

00:00:57.223 --> 00:01:04.564
Then you'll have fluffed egg, like savory steamed egg custard.

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:08.868
I love steamed egg custard and pudding,

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:12.505
so I'm having healthy breakfasts like that lately.

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:15.175
Please do try it yourselves.

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:19.212
Well then, let's start this week's The N-ko Show!

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:25.251
We had done this as a special segment before,

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:28.154
but we're going to make it a regular one.

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:32.859
Please use it as a reference to help you say some famous lines in Japanese.

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:35.562
I'm going to speak in English from here.

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:38.164
This week's quotes will be from...

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:45.872
MISS KOBAYASHI'S DRAGON MAID Season 2 has started airing

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:48.575
in summer of 2021.

00:01:48.575 --> 00:01:50.677
The first quote is...

00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:53.580
"I will pick where I belong."

00:01:54.014 --> 00:01:56.049
So this quote is...

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:03.757
Basically, it's saying that Tohru has the freedom

00:02:03.757 --> 00:02:07.460
to choose wherever she goes as she pleases.

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:17.771
So, "I will pick where I belong."

00:02:17.771 --> 00:02:23.009
So "I will choose where I belong" is basically the translation.

00:02:33.186 --> 00:02:34.554
"Isn't it really awesome?"

00:02:48.268 --> 00:02:51.471
And to pronounce it like Kanna-chan...

00:03:01.815 --> 00:03:03.750
"Isn't it really awesome?"

00:03:09.322 --> 00:03:10.857
"Isn't it really awesome?"

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:17.130
And this phrase is used a lot in Japanese as well,

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:21.701
so anytime you think of, you think something is "wow",

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:26.206
or you think something is "whoa", it's kind of like "wow".

00:03:33.413 --> 00:03:34.781
"Isn't it really awesome?"

00:03:38.118 --> 00:03:39.786
Oh, "Isn't it really awesome?"

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:41.788
I hope this tutorial helps you guys

00:03:41.788 --> 00:03:46.860
to pronounce these two very famous quotes from MISS KOBAYASHI'S DRAGON MAID.

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:50.196
Please try to use them in your daily life.

00:03:50.196 --> 00:03:53.099
That's it for N-ko's Japanese.

00:03:54.167 --> 00:03:59.572
The N-ko Show! It's now time to say goodbye.

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:02.175
