00:04:02.175 --> 00:04:06.479
I introduced anime quotes you can use in daily life,

00:04:06.479 --> 00:04:11.484
and I also told you how to make the breakfast I'm lately addicted to.

00:04:11.484 --> 00:04:15.755
Please do use them in your daily life.

00:04:15.755 --> 00:04:18.358
